id: encompassing-attack
name: Encompassing Attack
kind: signature
side: advantages
tpCost: 11
tpCostPerRank: 11, 5
ranks: 2
requirement: This Attacking Maneuver possesses an AoE.
requires: aoe
summary: Defend costs +2(bT) per rank against it; at rank 2 no Parry and no Unique Ability Counter but Barrier.
description: >
  This attack is nearly impossible to stop.
text: >
  Encompassing Attack: This attack is nearly impossible to stop.
  –TP Cost: 11 (First Rank), 5 (Second Rank)
  –Requirement: This Attacking Maneuver possesses an AoE.
  –Effect: For each rank of this Advantage, increase the Ki Point Cost of the Defend Maneuver used in response to this Attacking Maneuver by 2(bT). If you have 2 ranks of this Advantage applied to an Attacking Maneuver, no target of this Attacking Maneuver can use the Parry option of the Defend Maneuver or any Unique Ability that is a Counter Maneuver (except Barrier) in response to it.

---

